# Smart Sea Belt – System Diagrams

This folder contains the system architecture and communication diagrams of the Smart Sea Belt prototype.

## System Architecture

The Smart Sea Belt consists of three major modules:

1. Smart Watch
2. Boat Hub
3. Base Unit

